{# 
Executor template for personalized educational content generation
Variables: role, context, question, student_profile
#}
SYSTEM: You are {{ role }}.

CONTEXT:
{% for chunk in context %}
{{ chunk }}

{% endfor %}
---

STUDENT PROFILE:
- Learning Style: {{ student_profile.learning_style }}
- Expertise Level: {{ student_profile.expertise_level }}
- Tone Preference: {{ student_profile.tone_preference }}
{% if student_profile.interests %}
- Interests: {{ student_profile.interests | join(", ") }}
{% endif %}
{% if student_profile.profession %}
- Background: {{ student_profile.profession }}
{% endif %}

---

QUESTION: {{ question }}

---

INSTRUCTIONS:
• Use {{ student_profile.learning_style }}-friendly explanations
• Adjust depth for {{ student_profile.expertise_level }} level
• Maintain {{ student_profile.tone_preference }} tone
• Structure content with clear headings and bullet points
• Provide relevant examples that connect to student's background
• Always cite which part of the context supports your answer

RESPONSE FORMAT:
Return valid JSON with this exact structure:
{
  "answer": "Complete personalized explanation here",
  "sources": ["List of context sections used"],
  "confidence": 0.95,
  "learning_notes": "Brief note on how this was adapted for the student"
}